  "body_html": "<p>name: Mónada Nómada<br />date: 2018-05-14<br />type: video mapping<br />event: Residência Artística Rui Gato</p>\n<p>city: Caldas da Rainha, Portugal<br />place: CCC.CR</p>\n<p>client: CCC.CR<br />collaboration: n/a</p>\n<p>description PT: Espectículo audiovisual inserido no contexto da residência artística no CCC.CR. <br />Uma projecção processada e interpretada em tempo real, com 50 metros de comprimento, na fachada do edifício principal do CCC.CR, com 17 minutos de duração, mais um período de interactividade onde o público foi convidado a participar. Curiosidade: o ficheiro do projecto (incluíndo a musica) tinha apenas 1024 Kb.</p>\n<p>description EN: Audiovisual show set within the context of the artistic residency at CCC.CR.<br />A projection processed and interpreted in real time, spanning 50 metres on the facade of the main CCC.CR building, with a duration of 17 minutes, plus an interactive period where the audience was invited to participate. Curiosity: the project file (including the music) was only 1024 Kb.</p>\n<p>links:</p>\n<p><!-- .photonic-stream or .photonic-panel --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LbC6xWsg0iw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"embed-handler\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-embed-handler wp-block-embed-embed-handler wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/embed/LbC6xWsg0iw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:photonic/gallery {\"shortcode\":\"{\\u0022type\\u0022:\\u0022flickr\\u0022,\\u0022view\\u0022:\\u0022photosets\\u0022,\\u0022photoset_id\\u0022:\\u002272157697270325755\\u0022,\\u0022user_id\\u0022:\\u0022141356798@N05\\u0022,\\u0022columns\\u0022:\\u0022auto\\u0022,\\u0022layout\\u0022:\\u0022circle\\u0022}\"} /-->",
